# Cloudflare Pages custom headers — applied to every response.
#
# Dashboard HTML and any asset must NEVER be browser-cached. The operator
# relies on picking up `wrangler pages deploy` updates within seconds.
# Default Pages caching rules (cache-control: public, max-age=0,
# must-revalidate) let browsers serve the previously-stored copy for a
# long time under lossy networks. These headers kill that entirely.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0
